# The custom arm's elbow and shoulder (#385.3): the shots arms-roll does not take - the right hand held at chest
# height ahead, pulled in to the chest (the tightest bend, drawn at most 150 degrees), reached out almost straight,
# and ahead with the hand rolled, each seen from above so the elbow and the shoulder seam are in the picture.
# status.json vr.body.right.custom: the sleeve's last ring meets the glove's cuff (wristGap), the drawn bend is
# clamped (drawnBend), the logical arm is untouched (error).
#   .\scripts\dev\xrs-run.ps1 arms-elbow
#   .\scripts\dev\smoke-test.ps1 -VrSim idle -Sequence arms-elbow -Save mvp-new-game
@sim idle
@save mvp-new-game
@args --loadslot 0

@until state eq GAMEPLAY 60s
@until vr.sim.timelineFrame ge 270 60s       # 3 s into the level: past its fade-in (TRAPS.md)
@assert player.controlsBlocked eq false
# The custom arms: a test-only model since #466 (classic is the default) until #486 removes it
arms custom
@frames 5
@assert vr.body.armsModel eq custom

vr-sim head rot 0 -65 0
vr-sim hand left off

# 1. Ahead at chest height, the fingers forward: a right-angle bend below the eyes
vr-sim hand right pos 0.12 -0.2 -0.35
vr-sim hand right rot 0 90 0
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.posed eq true
@assert vr.body.right.error lt 1
@assert vr.body.right.custom.drawn eq true
@assert vr.body.right.custom.wristGap lt 0.5
@shot elbow-ahead

# 2. Pulled in to the chest: the tightest bend; the sleeve is drawn bent at most 150 degrees
vr-sim hand right pos 0.06 -0.12 -0.1
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.custom.drawn eq true
@assert vr.body.right.custom.drawnBend lt 150.5
@assert vr.body.right.custom.wristGap lt 0.5
@shot elbow-tight

# 3. Reached out, nearly straight
vr-sim hand right pos 0.2 -0.3 -0.55
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.custom.drawn eq true
@assert vr.body.right.custom.drawnBend lt 60
@assert vr.body.right.custom.wristGap lt 0.5
@shot elbow-straight

# 4. Ahead again with the hand rolled a quarter turn each way: the twist goes into the forearm, not the elbow
vr-sim hand right pos 0.12 -0.2 -0.35
vr-sim hand right rot 90 0 90
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.custom.wristGap lt 0.5
@shot elbow-roll090
vr-sim hand right rot -90 0 -90
@frames 15
@assert vr.body.right.custom.wristGap lt 0.5
@shot elbow-roll-090

@assert errors eq 0
